{"version":1,"content":"<p>天文台今午（23日）2時45分表示，乾燥的東北季候風正為廣東帶來晴朗的天氣。</p><p>本港下午天氣炎熱，截至下午2時30分，天文台錄得最高氣溫32.1°C，是有紀錄以來最熱的霜降。</p><p>【相關熱點：霜降養生要「平補潤燥健脾」 可多吃栗子蓮子鴨肉烏雞】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:23:54.664357+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:55:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:09.352710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.675108+00:00","content_hash":"27cac6338757af14a7306f4153ba38967f88daeeff5cb1d48399daa9f2f55d46","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}